  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
  <span class="os-caption">The experimental results of electron diffraction on a nickel target for the accelerating potential in the electron gun of about <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn><mtext>V</mtext><mo>:</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn><mtext>V</mtext><mo>:</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math> The intensity maximum is registered at the scattering angle of about <math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>°</mtext></mrow><mo>.</mo></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>
</figcaption></figure></div>

